WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.340
If you take iron supplements or a multivitamin that contains iron, please stop

2
00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:04.960
taking them about

3
00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:09.360
one week before your procedure. Iron can interfere with your bowel prep and

4
00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:10.320
make it harder to see

5
00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:15.040
clearly during the colonoscopy. Check your multivitamin label too, as many

6
00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:16.640
contain iron even if it's not

7
00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:21.450
obvious. If you're unsure whether a specific supplement is okay to continue,

8
00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:22.160
reach out to

9
00:00:22.160 --> 00:00:24.740
your doctor's office before making any changes.
